    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specimen</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where you play as a young girl born and raised inside a secret military research facility. Used as a living experiment in a classified bio-engineering project, you\u2019ve only ever known the cold walls of the lab\u2026 and the creatures locked away behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the creatures has escaped.<br>The soldiers have fled.<br>The base has collapsed into chaos.<br>And you\u2019re finally free \u2014 but not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of the facility, sneak past horrifying mutants, scavenge for supplies, and find a way out. But the deeper you go, the more you uncover what they did to you\u2026 and what you truly are.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specimen</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where you play as a young girl born and raised inside a secret military research facility. Used as a living experiment in a classified bio-engineering project, you\u2019ve only ever known the cold walls of the lab\u2026 and the creatures locked away behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the creatures has escaped.<br>The soldiers have fled.<br>The base has collapsed into chaos.<br>And you\u2019re finally free \u2014 but not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of the facility, sneak past horrifying mutants, scavenge for supplies, and find a way out. But the deeper you go, the more you uncover what they did to you\u2026 and what you truly are.</p>",
